        </p>

        <br>

        <p>

            Ya Allah,
            berkatilah majlis perkahwinan ini,
            satukanlah hati kedua mempelai,
            kurniakanlah kebahagiaan,
            kasih sayang dan rahmat-Mu
            hingga ke syurga.

        </p>

        <br><br>

        <h3 class="couple-footer-name">

            Haziq
            <br>
            &
            <br>
            Fatnin

        </h3>

        <p>
            3 Januari 2027
        </p>

    </div>

</section>

<div class="section-divider"></div>

<section class="container text-center animate-section">

    <div class="glass-card">

        <h2>Ucapan & Doa 🤍</h2>

        <p>
            Tinggalkan ucapan dan doa buat kami.
        </p>

        <input
            type="text"
            id="wishName"
            class="form-control mb-3"
            placeholder="Daripada" />

        <textarea
            id="wishMessage"
            class="form-control mb-3"
            rows="4"
            placeholder="Ucapan & Doa"></textarea>

        <button
            class="location-btn"
            onclick="addWish()">

            Hantar Ucapan

        </button>

        <div id="wishContainer"
             class="wish-container mt-4">

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<div class="section-divider"></div>

<footer class="text-center mt-5 mb-5">

    <p>
        Made with 🤍
    </p>

    <p>
        Haziq & Fatnin
    </p>

</footer>



<audio id="bgMusic" loop>
    <source src="/audio/wedding.mp3" />
</audio>

<button id="musicToggle" class="music-toggle">

    🔊

</button>

